  "description": "This questionnaire is used for the administrative recording of previously made advance care planning (ACP) treatment agreements and to document whether the patient has been informed about their responsibilities and about sharing these agreements. This questionnaire contains a subset of questions from the ACP-zib2020 questionnaire, using the same item.linkId values to ensure consistency and interoperability.",
  "purpose": "The questionnaire supports healthcare professionals in the administrative registration of existing ACP treatment agreements and in documenting the arrangements made about informing relatives and sharing these agreements with other involved healthcare providers.",
